00:16:50,884 --> 00:16:53,884
That's why you love movies so much.

253
00:16:53,884 --> 00:16:54,884
No, no, no, no, no, no.

254
00:16:54,884 --> 00:16:57,884
No, no, no, no, you get a lot of ideas from books.

255
00:16:57,884 --> 00:17:00,816
I could see how great you are.

256
00:17:00,816 --> 00:17:06,216
I could see how great you are. I visited your place, right?

257
00:17:06,216 --> 00:17:13,416
Mr. Wataridan's office, well, it's a lot of different rooms for different purposes, but...

258
00:17:13,416 --> 00:17:19,616
