262
00:17:27,008 --> 00:17:32,388
I'm not sure if I'm familiar with some of them, but there are recent works from all eras.

263
00:17:32,388 --> 00:17:34,808
And not only that, there's a lot more.

264
00:17:34,808 --> 00:17:37,628
Uberber, this is a fortune.

265
00:17:37,628 --> 00:17:45,848
There's a string in the mouth, and you pull it out, and the number that comes out is written on the shelf, and you go to the shelf and take it.

266
00:17:45,848 --> 00:17:48,448
The second one, the third one, the third one...

267
00:17:48,448 --> 00:17:52,188
What happens? Uberber is a love fortune.

268
00:17:52,188 --> 00:17:55,148
And this is a love fortune, and it came out “Chukichi”...

269
00:17:55,148 --> 00:17:56,976
And Zenibar...

270
00:17:56,976 --> 00:18:05,776
Zenibar is a place where you can not only look at the fortune, but also enjoy it.

271
00:18:05,776 --> 00:18:06,976
It was a lot of fun.

272
00:18:06,976 --> 00:18:09,476
This is the shelf, right?

273
00:18:09,476 --> 00:18:11,476
The kamaji? Yes, yes.

