00:18:15,976 --> 00:18:19,476
That sounds like fun. It was a lot of fun.

276
00:18:19,476 --> 00:18:20,476
You know...

277
00:18:20,476 --> 00:18:25,776
I think it's still open.

278
00:18:25,776 --> 00:18:31,176
But a medium fortune is the most boring.

279
00:18:31,176 --> 00:18:33,736
Please stop it, I got a “Chukichi” fortune.

280
00:18:33,736 --> 00:18:34,816
