281
00:18:34,816 --> 00:18:39,616
I'll do “Chukichi” too. I'm thinking of changing my name to “Chukichi”.

282
00:18:39,616 --> 00:18:40,516
That's how much you'll get?

283
00:18:40,536 --> 00:18:44,796
Yes! I can't remember ever getting anything other than “Chukichi”.

284
00:18:44,796 --> 00:18:46,016
Really?

285
00:18:46,056 --> 00:18:47,416
I don't even have a “big” luck.

286
00:18:47,416 --> 00:18:54,596
So what's that? Big luck, good luck, medium luck, small luck...

287
00:18:55,216 --> 00:18:57,216
Like today... In order...

288
00:18:57,216 --> 00:18:59,216
I'd say you're right in the middle.

289
00:18:59,216 --> 00:19:01,216
It's harmless.

290
00:19:01,216 --> 00:19:03,216
You can have a bland love life.

291
00:19:03,216 --> 00:19:05,216
Really? Really?

292
00:19:05,216 --> 00:19:07,216
It's bland.

293
00:19:07,216 --> 00:19:09,216
Well, that's good.

294
00:19:09,216 --> 00:19:11,216
If nothing else.

