296
00:19:14,144 --> 00:19:16,844
I think there was a lot of nostalgia. It's like the Showa Era.

297
00:19:16,844 --> 00:19:20,344
Animage magazine... I think it was a magazine called Animage or something like that.

298
00:19:20,344 --> 00:19:24,544
That's what you were working on, wasn't it?

299
00:19:24,544 --> 00:19:25,944
Yes, that's right. Like an editor.

