00:19:25,944 --> 00:19:27,944
That's how you met, right? At Mr. Miyazaki's place.

301
00:19:27,944 --> 00:19:29,304
Very often.

302
00:19:29,304 --> 00:19:32,144
But he wrote some great quotes.

303
00:19:32,144 --> 00:19:33,744
Mr. Suzuki, I can say the same thing.

304
00:19:33,744 --> 00:19:35,244
That's right. And calligraphy, too.

305
00:19:35,244 --> 00:19:38,444
I can do both calligraphy and art.

306
00:19:38,444 --> 00:19:42,444
I can do both calligraphy and art, so I only need to get serious once every three months.

307
00:19:42,444 --> 00:19:43,744
There was a quote like that.

308
00:19:43,792 --> 00:19:49,292
You were wearing a nightgown during the interview. Well, I wasn't really serious.

309
00:19:49,292 --> 00:19:54,592
It wasn't exactly the day of the once-every-three-months interview, but he was really trying to make the job fun and easy.

310
00:19:54,592 --> 00:19:59,492
It did look fun and easy, because it was like a sweatshirt.

311
00:19:59,492 --> 00:20:04,392
